00:05:12,108 --> 00:05:17,808
You know, come to think of it, it's been two years since we broke out of the cell, huh?

44
00:05:18,008 --> 00:05:21,008
Yeah, time goes by fast, yeah.

45
00:05:22,008 --> 00:05:24,508
We've been through a lot, right?

46
00:05:25,008 --> 00:05:27,008
Huh? What? Hey, guys!

47
00:05:27,108 --> 00:05:29,808
What's that over there?!

48
00:05:30,008 --> 00:05:32,008
Huh? What is that?

49
00:05:37,008 --> 00:05:40,808
Attention. Justice. Elizabeth Rose Bloodflame.

50
00:05:41,008 --> 00:05:43,808
Initiating final warning protocol.

51
00:05:44,208 --> 00:05:47,008
Five escapees detected from the cell.

52
00:05:47,208 --> 00:05:50,508
Repeat: Five escapees detected from the cell.

53
00:05:51,008 --> 00:05:53,008
Targets are as follows.

54
00:05:53,508 --> 00:05:57,208
The Demon of Sound, Nerissa Ravencroft.

55
00:05:58,008 --> 00:06:01,808
The Jewel of Emotions, Koseki Bijou.

56
00:06:02,508 --> 00:06:05,808
The Fluffy One, Fuwawa Abyssgard.

57
00:06:06,508 --> 00:06:09,808
The Fuzzy One, Mococo Abyssgard.

58
00:06:10,508 --> 00:06:13,808
The Archiver, Shiori Novella.

59
00:06:14,808 --> 00:06:18,508
All units, apprehend the Advent members immediately!

60
00:06:25,008 --> 00:06:27,008
Oh my god! What do we do?!

61
00:06:27,108 --> 00:06:30,208
Oh no, we're in trouble! It's payback time!

62
00:06:30,508 --> 00:06:34,008
They're gonna catch us!

63
00:06:47,508 --> 00:06:50,808
I can't go back! I can't go back!

64
00:06:51,008 --> 00:06:53,808
What are we gonna do?!

65
00:06:54,008 --> 00:06:57,208
Oh well, guess we're doomed!

66
00:06:57,508 --> 00:07:00,808
Guys, think! There's gotta be a solution for this, right?

67
00:07:01,008 --> 00:07:03,508
Piggyback ride! Come on, piggyback ride!

68
00:07:03,808 --> 00:07:08,508
Get on! Piggyback ride! I'll carry you!

69
00:07:09,008 --> 00:07:12,508
Okay, maybe not that one. Yeah, sorry.

70
00:07:12,808 --> 00:07:15,808
There's gotta be something, like a Plan B or something we can do!

71
00:07:16,008 --> 00:07:18,808
Bwahaha! Struggling already?

72
00:07:19,008 --> 00:07:21,808
Pokey?! What are you doing here?!

73
00:07:22,008 --> 00:07:25,008
You finally show your face, huh?!

74
00:07:25,508 --> 00:07:28,808
Ask nicely enough, and maybe I'll save your skins.

75
00:07:29,008 --> 00:07:31,508
Come on! Come on!

76
00:07:31,808 --> 00:07:34,008
Here, I have a solution.

77
00:07:34,208 --> 00:07:36,808
Mwah! Please help us, Pokey!

78
00:07:37,008 --> 00:07:39,808
Don't resist! Help us, Pokey!

79
00:07:40,008 --> 00:07:42,008
Hmph! I don't hate that.

80
00:07:42,208 --> 00:07:44,208
If you manage to pass the little trial I've cooked up for you,

81
00:07:44,508 --> 00:07:47,008
I'll whisk you away to a whole other realm...

82
00:07:47,208 --> 00:07:50,008
One where your pesky pursuers can't reach you!

83
00:07:50,208 --> 00:07:53,008
I mean, I guess that's our only option, huh?

84
00:07:53,208 --> 00:07:55,508
Oh well, guess we will do it!

85
00:07:56,008 --> 00:08:00,008
Alright. I've prepared something special. Arise, my go-karts!

86
00:08:01,008 --> 00:08:06,008
Go-Karts?!

87
00:08:07,008 --> 00:08:09,008
Wait, we don't have a license!

88
00:08:09,208 --> 00:08:14,008
Why? What about it? When do the people seeing us even stop?

89
00:08:15,008 --> 00:08:19,508
See this course? Time to tackle the 'Go-Kart Escape Challenge'!

90
00:08:20,008 --> 00:08:23,508
Oh! Escape Challenge!

91
00:08:24,008 --> 00:08:26,508
Yes, that's right. Take it from here, ankle-biter.

92
00:08:26,808 --> 00:08:30,208
Who are you talking to, huh? Ankle-biter?!

93
00:08:30,508 --> 00:08:33,508
Calm down there. Well, actually...

94
00:08:34,008 --> 00:08:38,008
Alright team! Game rules are incoming, so make sure you better listen, okay?

95
00:08:38,208 --> 00:08:40,008
Okay!

96
00:08:44,008 --> 00:08:46,508
Yeah! Nice!

97
00:08:47,008 --> 00:08:50,008
Wait, Bijou, how do you know the game rules?

98
00:08:50,508 --> 00:08:54,508
It's the glasses! That's how she knows! Glasses!

99
00:08:55,008 --> 00:09:01,008
Rule 1: Survive 2 laps with zombies on your tail!

100
00:09:01,208 --> 00:09:04,008
Zombies?! Where?!

101
00:09:04,208 --> 00:09:07,008
Remember, last year we beat up zombies?

102
00:09:07,208 --> 00:09:12,508
Well, one of them went on a path to revenge, and now it's gonna run after you!

103
00:09:13,008 --> 00:09:15,508
Oh, okay, sounds good!

104
00:09:16,008 --> 00:09:23,008
Rule 2: Collect items for bonus points, but watch out for traps that deduct points!

105
00:09:23,508 --> 00:09:26,508
Oh no! Deduct points?!

106
00:09:27,008 --> 00:09:32,008
Rule 3: Victory is ours if we all get 30 points total!

107
00:09:32,208 --> 00:09:37,008
30 points?! Easy, right? We can do that!

108
00:09:38,008 --> 00:09:41,508
And now I will explain the course items!

109
00:09:41,808 --> 00:09:44,508
I must run! - You must run? - Yeah, I must run.

110
00:09:45,008 --> 00:09:49,008
I'm gonna live out my dreams while there's a track here! Just explain, ignore me!

111
00:09:49,208 --> 00:09:54,008
Okay, isn't she listening? Wow, she's fast!

112
00:09:54,508 --> 00:10:00,008
There are crystals on the field! Beautiful crystals over there!

113
00:10:00,016 --> 00:10:01,216
Two more over there.

114
00:10:01,216 --> 00:10:02,816
They are gacha!

115
00:10:03,216 --> 00:10:06,516
You'll either gain points or lose points based on...

116
00:10:06,516 --> 00:10:09,816
...but you don't know, so it's a risk every time.

117
00:10:10,516 --> 00:10:12,516
Yeah, and then there is...

118
00:10:12,516 --> 00:10:16,816
...the big Moai! The big Moai!

119
00:10:17,316 --> 00:10:19,316
It will block your path.

120
00:10:22,016 --> 00:10:25,816
It is minus 20 points if you hit it, so don't hit it.

121
00:10:26,516 --> 00:10:30,016
Don't hit it! Yeah, don't hit it!

122
00:10:30,216 --> 00:10:32,816
And then, the Pebble!

123
00:10:33,216 --> 00:10:39,216
I have kidnapped one of my Pebbles to use as a sacrifice if you hit it...

124
00:10:39,516 --> 00:10:44,016
...minus 5 points, but you know what? I don't think they'd mind if you hit it, to be honest.

125
00:10:48,516 --> 00:10:51,516
And the items will change...

126
00:10:51,516 --> 00:10:55,816
...depending on your first lap or second lap. You're doing two laps.

127
00:10:56,016 --> 00:10:58,016
Two laps. Two laps.

128
00:10:58,216 --> 00:11:01,216
You can run another two laps!

129
00:11:02,016 --> 00:11:04,016
Yeah, no, I'm great.

130
00:11:06,116 --> 00:11:08,516
I guess time to show you how it's done.

131
00:11:08,516 --> 00:11:11,216
Show us! Go on! Go on!

132
00:11:12,616 --> 00:11:15,516
All right, first lap, show us how to do it.

133
00:11:15,516 --> 00:11:17,016
I'm ready!

134
00:11:21,016 --> 00:11:23,516
Go! Go, Bijou!

135
00:11:24,016 --> 00:11:27,516
First lap, first lap! She got the crystal! She makes a turn!

136
00:11:27,516 --> 00:11:30,016
Second crystal! Watch out!

137
00:11:31,516 --> 00:11:33,616
She's going so fast!

138
00:11:33,616 --> 00:11:36,016
The zombie's actually speeding up!

139
00:11:36,016 --> 00:11:38,216
Second lap, let's go! Let's go!

140
00:11:38,216 --> 00:11:40,016
Another crystal!

141
