She hit another one!

142
00:11:43,016 --> 00:11:45,016
Watch out!

143
00:11:45,016 --> 00:11:48,016
The zombie! Watch out!

144
00:11:49,016 --> 00:11:52,016
The zombie's speeding up!

145
00:11:58,216 --> 00:12:01,216
I think you got a bit of bad luck with that crystal at the end.

146
00:12:04,216 --> 00:12:07,516
It's okay, that's a pretty good run. Did I do fast?
It's okay, that's a pretty good run. Did I go fast?

147
00:12:08,016 --> 00:12:10,516
Did I go fast? You went so fast!

148
00:12:10,516 --> 00:12:13,516
You almost hit the zombie, but you're okay!

149
00:12:13,516 --> 00:12:15,816
You didn't die!

150
00:12:15,816 --> 00:12:17,816
How many points did I get? How many points?

151
00:12:18,016 --> 00:12:21,216
That's a good question. How many points did you get?

152
00:12:21,216 --> 00:12:23,016
I think you got one point.

153
00:12:23,016 --> 00:12:27,016
What? One point? After all that? One point.

154
00:12:27,016 --> 00:12:29,816
Did I have bad gacha luck?

155
00:12:29,816 --> 00:12:32,216
It's a group effort, we can still get points.

156
00:12:32,216 --> 00:12:34,516
Yeah, I contributed one! One!

157
00:12:34,516 --> 00:12:37,016
One is great! One is great!

158
00:12:37,016 --> 00:12:41,016
You can have like the pro do all the work for you, right? Yeah!

159
00:12:41,016 --> 00:12:45,016
Pro Mococo! Yeah, yeah! I count on you guys!

160
00:12:45,016 --> 00:12:48,816
Next up is Shiori!

161
00:12:49,016 --> 00:12:52,516
Show us how it's done, our fearless leader! I have a plan.

162
00:12:53,016 --> 00:12:55,016
What's your plan?

163
00:12:55,016 --> 00:12:58,216
You'll figure it out when I say plan!

164
00:12:58,216 --> 00:13:00,816
Good luck, Shiori!

165
00:13:01,016 --> 00:13:04,516
あの、ゾンビだ！　先導ゾンビ！
Um, it's a zombie! The zombie ahead!

166
00:13:05,516 --> 00:13:10,516
はい、いい子ですね。いい子ですね。
Yes, good boy. Good boy.

167
00:13:13,516 --> 00:13:16,016
Let's go! Yeah, that's a good idea.

168
00:13:16,016 --> 00:13:18,816
Come on, let's go, let's go!

169
00:13:19,016 --> 00:13:22,016
いい子ですね。走れ！
Good boy. Run!

170
00:13:22,016 --> 00:13:25,016
She's running! Get away!

171
00:13:25,016 --> 00:13:28,016
What is she doing?

172
00:13:28,016 --> 00:13:31,016
Get away! Get away!

173
00:13:33,016 --> 00:13:36,016
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

174
00:13:36,516 --> 00:13:40,016
It's like driving in New York!

175
00:13:40,016 --> 00:13:42,516
Only thing I got... That's okay, I'll figure it out.

176
00:13:43,016 --> 00:13:45,516
How is this driving in New York?

177
00:13:45,516 --> 00:13:48,816
Okay, okay, okay!

178
00:13:53,516 --> 00:13:57,016
You didn't catch him, but you sure gave him a run for his money!

179
00:13:57,016 --> 00:14:00,016
I didn't care about the points, I just wanted to run them over!

180
00:14:00,016 --> 00:14:02,016
Understandable.

181
00:14:02,016 --> 00:14:05,016
How many points did I get?

182
00:14:06,516 --> 00:14:09,016
Three points! Three points!

183
00:14:09,016 --> 00:14:11,816
That's for running you over.

184
00:14:11,816 --> 00:14:15,516
That's three points! That's pretty good! That's better than one!

185
00:14:16,016 --> 00:14:19,816
So we have four! Alright, Fuwawa's turn!

186
00:14:20,016 --> 00:14:22,516
Do you think you can do it?

187
00:14:23,016 --> 00:14:27,516
Get four points! You can do it, I know you can!

188
00:14:27,516 --> 00:14:31,516
The zombie is not going to run away anymore, so...

189
00:14:31,516 --> 00:14:33,516
I think it's tired.

190
00:14:33,516 --> 00:14:36,816
It's easier, you can outrun it. I'm the best driver!

191
00:14:37,016 --> 00:14:39,516
Go, Fuwawa!

192
00:14:42,016 --> 00:14:45,016
Go, Fuwawa! Go!

193
00:14:46,016 --> 00:14:49,016
You're kind of going slow!

194
00:14:49,016 --> 00:14:52,016
What do you mean? I want to go safe!

195
00:14:52,016 --> 00:14:56,016
It's very safe driving!

196
00:14:56,016 --> 00:14:59,816
Why am I so slow? But the zombie...

197
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:02,124
It's so slow!

198
00:15:02,124 --> 00:15:03,924
Go, Fuwawa, go!

199
00:15:04,024 --> 00:15:06,224
A crystal! Oh no!

200
00:15:07,524 --> 00:15:09,524
Fire crystal!

201
00:15:09,824 --> 00:15:11,224
It's okay, it's okay!

202
00:15:11,324 --> 00:15:14,624
Go, go, go, go, go!

203
00:15:14,624 --> 00:15:16,824
Go, Fuwawa!

204
00:15:18,524 --> 00:15:22,024
Why is it so slow this time? Go faster!

205
00:15:22,524 --> 00:15:24,824
Crystal, crystal! Ah, wrong crystal!

206
00:15:25,224 --> 00:15:27,824
Watch out, watch out! Zombie, watch out!

207
